# PROJEX

A personal portal that centralizes documents and tools into one place.
Each sidebar item opens a different module — calendar, Excel workbooks,
design system, etc. — inside an embedded iframe.

## Structure

- `index.html` — the shell (sidebar + iframe router)
- `modules/` — individual module pages
  - `room-scheduler.html` — calendar, backed by a Google Apps Script
  - `rfc.html` — embedded SharePoint Excel workbook
  - `ui-guidelines.html` — design system viewer with GitHub sync / upload
  - the rest are placeholders ready to be replaced

## Updating a module

Replace the corresponding file in `modules/` and commit. Within ~30
seconds the live site picks up the change.
